<title>JAPAN: Osaka Sanso - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Osaka Sanso - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 27.98		vs	   27.30</p>
<p> Operating	    1.39		vs	  852    million</p>
<p> Current		1.19		vs	  599    million</p>
<p> Net		  441    million	  vs	  855    million</p>
<p> EPS		    5.26 yen	  vs	   10.16 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     84 million	  vs	  84 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  2.50 yen	  vs	    2.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Osaka Sanso Kogyo Ltd is a manufacturer of industrial gases.</p>
